Comment: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:29.84,Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz159.478\fnArial Rounded MT Bold\fs24\c&H76765D&\pos(669,130)}Saionji Maron
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:56.07,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I can't tell what'll come tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:59.49,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}This is different than making a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.49,0:01:01.20,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Something about it is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:04.83,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}And I don't think of it as some sort of forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.83,0:01:08.04,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}So I just don't get why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:11.50,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I can't quite wrap my head around it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:17.51,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)\fscx90}but your existence is now much more than just important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:23.47,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}There's nothing in this world that doesn't come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:27.81,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I don't cry because I'm hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.81,0:01:30.48,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}They're the sweet, sweet drops of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:34.03,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I want to go on dreaming forever, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:37.45,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I want to try and be more gentle, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.45,0:01:40.87,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}If I can be with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.87,0:01:44.29,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Girls are really strong, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.29,0:01:47.71,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}But sometimes, they can be really weak, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:54.01,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Our wishes are happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:57.97,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}And our days will be just as happy!
