Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:21.15,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}A sunny Sunday's early afternoon;
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.15,0:20:24.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:30.91,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}The same old road that I'm so used to walking on...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.91,0:20:36.00,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...shines with a dazzling light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.71,0:20:40.63,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}If I have the warm sunlight shining down on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:45.93,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...and you by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:56.06,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My feelings are ready to burst forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:21:01.15,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.15,0:21:06.36,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My voice reaches every corner of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:11.58,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I'm already high, high, high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:17.21,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Riding the whirling winds...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:21.59,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:27.51,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My voice swoops up and down with me.
